  "title": "Cocada (Brazilian Coconut Sweet)",
  "description": "Cocada is a popular street food sold everywhere in Brazil. It's a sweet made with grated fresh coconut. There are many variations, this one with a hint of vanilla is one of them.",
  "authors": [
